<p>Big thank you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peppersghost" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1553042); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1553042&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534313369" alt="PeppersGhost" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1553042)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/peppersghost" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1553042); return false;">PeppersGhost</a></span> for chatting with me about how to make ListPages happen and to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/croquembouche" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2893766); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2893766&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534313369" alt="Croquembouche" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2893766)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/croquembouche" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2893766); return false;">Croquembouche</a></span> for help making that HTML work by being not HTML anymore. Big thank you to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/varaxous" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2433554); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2433554&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1534313369" alt="Varaxous" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2433554)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/varaxous" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2433554); return false;">Varaxous</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormfallen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2782824); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2782824&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=15