			<div class="content" id="post-content-3875306">
									

<p>One of the most impressively-built discoveries I've encountered. The first few iterations were a fantastic build-up (that first page trolled the hell out of me though).</p>
<p>My only (very minor) issue was the final iteration, as I was expecting this to unfold in an entirely different manner by focusing on more on C-51174. I still <em>enjoyed</em> it for what it was, but the shift in focus became a bit disappointing when I reached the end and realized there wasn't going to be more exploration of this purgatory and C-51174.</p>

