<p>I'd already started writing the tale series this is linked to re: his future and what happens to him, so I wrapped that part up as best I could in the History section of the final iteration, but I get how it could have been good if his narrative was different and had him in 4000 indefinitely or something so that he could keep serving as a window into it &#8212; of course, <em>any</em> of the E/4000 personnel can do that if they're willing and able to communicate through IntSCPFN, which is why I was okay taking him out of there. Regardless, glad you liked it!</p>

